SUMMARY:Robert's Totally Rad Trivia
DESCRIPTION:Join us every Thursday for Robert’s Totally Rad Trivia – pop culture trivia that hits all the good stuff: music\, TV\, movies\, video games\, food\, and everything in between. \nTrivia is free with a max number of six players per team. Grab your crew\, grab a brew\, and put that random knowledge to work. 🧠🍻
